ption (Arabic)", "type": "text", "label_en": "Main video caption (Arabic)", "label_fr": "L\u00e9gende de la vid\u00e9o principale (arabe)", "label_es": "Leyenda del video principal (\u00e1rabe)", "label_ar": "\u062a\u0639\u0644\u064a\u0642 \u0627\u0644\u0641\u064a\u062f\u064a\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u0631\u0626\u064a\u0633\u064a \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629", "description_en": null, "description_fr": null, "description_es": null, "description_ar": null}, {"name": "main_video_caption_zh", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "Main video caption (Chinese)", "type": "text", "label_en": "Main video caption (Chinese)", "label_fr": "L\u00e9gende de la vid\u00e9o principale (chinois)", "label_es": "Leyenda del video principal (chino)", "label_ar": "\u062a\u0639\u0644\u064a\u0642 \u0627\u0644\u0641\u064a\u062f\u064a\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u0631\u0626\u064a\u0633\u064a \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0635\u064a\u0646\u064a\u0629", "description_en": null, "description_fr": null, "description_es": null, "description_ar": null}, {"name": "videos_urls", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "Videos", "type": "text", "label_en": "Videos", "label_fr": "Vid\u00e9os", "label_es": "Videos", "label_ar": "\u0645\u0642\u0627\u0637\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u0641\u064a\u062f\u064a\u0648", "description_en": null, "description_fr": null, "description_es": null, "description_ar": null}, {"name": "components_list", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "Components", "type": "text", "label_en": "Components", "label_fr": "\u00c9l\u00e9ments constitutifs", "label_es": "Componentes", "label_ar": "\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0643\u0648\u0651\u0646\u0627\u062a", "description_en": null, "description_fr": null, "description_es": null, "description_ar": null}, {"name": "components_count", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "Number of components", "type": "int", "label_en": "Number of components", "label_fr": "Nombre d'\u00e9l\u00e9ments constitutifs", "label_es": "N\u00famero de componentes", "label_ar": "\u0639\u062f\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0643\u0648\u0651\u0646\u0627\u062a", "description_en": null, "description_fr": null, "description_es": null, "description_ar": null}, {"name": "geo_point_2d", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "geo_point_2d", "type": "geo_point_2d", "label_en": "geo_point_2d", "label_fr": "Coordonn\u00e9es", "label_es": "Coordenadas", "label_ar": "\u0627\u0644\u0625\u062d\u062f\u0627\u062b\u064a\u0627\u062a", "description_en": null, "description_fr": null, "description_es": null, "description_ar": null}], "dataset_id": "whc001", "dataset_uid": "da_t3aoce", "has_records": true, "features": ["analyze", "geo", "timeserie"], "attachments": [], "alternative_exports": [], "data_visible": true, "metas": {"default": {"title": "World Heritage List", "title_en": "World Heritage List", "title_fr": "Liste du patrimoine mondial", "title_es": "Lista del Patrimonio Mundial", "title_ar": "\u0642\u0627\u0626\u0645\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0631\u0627\u062b \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a", "description": "This dataset contains the UNESCO World Heritage List, showcasing sites of outstanding universal value recognized for their cultural, natural, or mixed significance. It includes information on site locations, criteria for inclusion, and the year of inscription, supporting efforts to safeguard the world\u2019s heritage for future generations.<br>", "description_en": "This dataset contains the UNESCO World Heritage List, showcasing sites of outstanding universal value recognized for their cultural, natural, or mixed significance. It includes information on site locations, criteria for inclusion, and the year of inscription, supporting efforts to safeguard the world\u2019s heritage for future generations.<br>", "description_fr": "Cet ensemble de donn\u00e9es contient la Liste du patrimoine mondial de l'UNESCO, qui r\u00e9pertorie les sites pr\u00e9sentant une valeur universelle exceptionnelle, reconnus pour leur importance culturelle, naturelle ou mixte. Il comprend des informations sur la localisation des sites, les crit\u00e8res d'inscription et l'ann\u00e9e d'inscription, contribuant ainsi aux efforts visant \u00e0 pr\u00e9server le patrimoine mondial pour les g\u00e9n\u00e9rations futures.", "description_es": "<p>Este conjunto de datos contiene la Lista del Patrimonio Mundial de la UNESCO, en la que se recogen los sitios de valor universal excepcional reconocidos por su importancia cultural, natural o mixta. Incluye informaci\u00f3n sobre la ubicaci\u00f3n de los sitios, los criterios de inclusi\u00f3n y el a\u00f1o de inscripci\u00f3n, lo que contribuye a los esfuerzos por salvaguardar el patrimonio mundial para las generaciones futuras.</p>", "description_ar": "\u062a\u062d\u062a\u0648\u064a \u0645\u062c\u0645\u0648\u0639\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u064a\u0627\u0646\u0627\u062a \u0647\u0630\u0647 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0642\u0627\u0626\u0645\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u064a\u0648\u0646\u0633\u0643\u0648 \u0644\u0644\u062a\u0631\u0627\u062b \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a\u060c \u0627\u0644\u062a\u064a \u062a\u0636\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0627\u0642\u0639 \u0630\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0642\u064a\u0645\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u0627\u0631\u0632\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0639\u062a\u0631\u0641 \u0628\u0647\u0627 \u0644\u0623\u0647\u0645\u064a\u062a\u0647\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u062b\u0642\u0627\u0641\u064a\u0629 \u0623\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u0637\u0628\u064a\u0639\u064a\u0629 \u0623\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062e\u062a\u0644\u0637\u0629. \u0648\u062a\u0634\u0645\u0644 \u0645\u0639\u0644\u0648\u0645\u0627\u062a \u0639\u0646 \u0645\u0648\u0627\u0642\u0639 \u0647\u0630\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0627\u0642\u0639\u060c \u0648\u0645\u0639\u0627\u064a\u064a\u0631 \u0625\u062f\u0631\u0627\u062c\u0647\u0627 \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0627\u0626\u0645\u0629\u060c \u0648\u0633\u0646\u0629 \u0625\u062f\u0631\u0627\u062c\u0647\u0627\u060c \u0645\u0645\u0627 \u064a\u062f\u0639\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0647\u0648\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0631\u0627\u0645\u064a\u0629 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u062d\u0641\u0627\u0638 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0631\u0627\u062b \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a \u0644\u0644\u0623\u062c\u064a\u0627\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0627\u062f\u0645\u0629.", "theme": ["Culture"], "theme_en": ["Culture"], "theme_fr": ["Culture"], "theme_es": ["Cultura"], "theme_ar": ["\u0627\u0644\u062b\u0642\u0627\u0641\u0629"], "keyword": ["World Heritage Sites", "Cultural and Natural Heritage", "UNESCO Conservation", "SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities", "SDG 15: Life on Land"], "keyword_en": ["World Heritage Sites", "Cultural and Natural Heritage", "UNESCO Conservation", "SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities", "SDG 15: Life on Land"], "keyword_fr": ["Sites du patrimoine mondial", "Patrimoine culturel et naturel", "Conservation de l'UNESCO", "ODD 11 : Villes et communaut\u00e9s durables", "ODD 15 : Vie terrestre"], "keyword_es": ["Patrimonio de la Humanidad", "Patrimonio cultural y natural", "Conservaci\u00f3n de la UNESCO", "ODS 11: Ciudades y comunidades sostenibles", "ODS 15: Vida de ecosistemas terrestres"], "keyword_ar": ["\u0645\u0648\u0627\u0642\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0631\u0627\u062b \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a", "\u0627\u0644\u062a\u0631\u0627\u062b \u0627\u0644\u062b\u0642\u0627\u0641\u064a \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0637\u0628\u064a\u0639\u064a", "\u0635\u0648\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0631\u0627\u062b \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u064a\u0648\u0646\u0633\u0643\u0648", "\u0627\u0644\u0647\u062f\u0641 11 \u0645\u0646 \u0623\u0647\u062f\u0627\u0641 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0646\u0645\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u062a\u062f\u0627\u0645\u0629: \u0645\u062f\u0646 \u0648\u0645\u062c\u062a\u0645\u0639\u0627\u062a \u0645\u062d\u0644\u064a\u0629 \u0645\u0633\u062a\u062f\u0627\u0645\u0629", "\u0627\u0644\u0647\u062f\u