u0651\u0631\u0629", "description_en": null, "description_fr": null, "description_es": null, "description_ar": null}, {"name": "thesaurus_domains", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "Thesaurus domains", "type": "text", "label_en": "Thesaurus domains", "label_fr": "Domaines du th\u00e9saurus", "label_es": "Dominios del tesauro", "label_ar": "\u0645\u062c\u0627\u0644\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0643\u0646\u0632", "description_en": null, "description_fr": null, "description_es": null, "description_ar": null}], "dataset_id": "exp001", "dataset_uid": "da_qnc8b2", "has_records": true, "features": ["timeserie", "analyze"], "attachments": [], "alternative_exports": [], "data_visible": true, "metas": {"default": {"title": "UNESCO Expertise Database", "title_en": "UNESCO Expertise Database", "title_fr": "Base de donn\u00e9es de l'expertise de l'UNESCO", "title_es": "Base de datos de conocimientos especializados de la UNESCO", "title_ar": "\u0642\u0627\u0639\u062f\u0629 \u0628\u064a\u0627\u0646\u0627\u062a \u062e\u0628\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u064a\u0648\u0646\u0633\u0643\u0648", "description": "Where UNESCO expertise lives: UNESCO Institutes and Programme Sectors, networks that carry the UNESCO name (UNESCO Chairs, Category 2 centres, Creative Cities, Learning Cities, World Book Capitals) and designated sites (World Heritage properties, Biosphere Reserves, Global Geoparks). Each record gives the entity's description, sector, themes and links.", "description_en": "Where UNESCO expertise lives: UNESCO Institutes and Programme Sectors, networks that carry the UNESCO name (UNESCO Chairs, Category 2 centres, Creative Cities, Learning Cities, World Book Capitals) and designated sites (World Heritage properties, Biosphere Reserves, Global Geoparks). Each record gives the entity's description, sector, themes and links.", "description_fr": "O\u00f9 se trouve l'expertise de l'UNESCO : les Instituts et Secteurs de programme de l'UNESCO, les r\u00e9seaux qui portent le nom de l'UNESCO (Chaires UNESCO, centres de cat\u00e9gorie 2, Villes cr\u00e9atives, Villes apprenantes, Capitales mondiales du livre) et les sites d\u00e9sign\u00e9s (biens du patrimoine mondial, r\u00e9serves de biosph\u00e8re, g\u00e9oparcs mondiaux). Chaque fiche donne la description de l'entit\u00e9, son secteur, ses th\u00e8mes et ses liens.", "description_es": "D\u00f3nde se encuentran los conocimientos especializados de la UNESCO: los Institutos y Sectores de Programa de la UNESCO, las redes que llevan el nombre de la UNESCO (C\u00e1tedras UNESCO, centros de categor\u00eda 2, Ciudades Creativas, Ciudades del Aprendizaje, Capitales Mundiales del Libro) y los sitios designados (bienes del Patrimonio Mundial, reservas de biosfera, geoparques mundiales). Cada ficha ofrece la descripci\u00f3n de la entidad, su sector, sus temas y sus enlaces.", "description_ar": "\u0623\u064a\u0646 \u062a\u0648\u062c\u062f \u062e\u0628\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u064a\u0648\u0646\u0633\u0643\u0648: \u0645\u0639\u0627\u0647\u062f \u0627\u0644\u064a\u0648\u0646\u0633\u0643\u0648 \u0648\u0642\u0637\u0627\u0639\u0627\u062a \u0628\u0631\u0627\u0645\u062c\u0647\u0627\u060c \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0634\u0628\u0643\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062a\u064a \u062a\u062d\u0645\u0644 \u0627\u0633\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u064a\u0648\u0646\u0633\u0643\u0648 (\u0643\u0631\u0627\u0633\u064a \u0627\u0644\u064a\u0648\u0646\u0633\u0643\u0648\u060c \u0648\u0645\u0631\u0627\u0643\u0632 \u0627\u0644\u0641\u0626\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062b\u0627\u0646\u064a\u0629\u060c \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0645\u062f\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0628\u062f\u0639\u0629\u060c \u0648\u0645\u062f\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0639\u0644\u0651\u0645\u060c \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0648\u0627\u0635\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a\u0629 \u0644\u0644\u0643\u062a\u0627\u0628) \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0627\u0642\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0639\u064a\u0651\u0646\u0629 (\u0645\u0645\u062a\u0644\u0643\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0631\u0627\u062b \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a\u060c \u0648\u0645\u062d\u0645\u064a\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062d\u064a\u0637 \u0627\u0644\u062d\u064a\u0648\u064a\u060c \u0648\u0627\u0644\u062d\u062f\u0627\u0626\u0642 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u064a\u0648\u0644\u0648\u062c\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a\u0629). \u0648\u064a\u0642\u062f\u0651\u0645 \u0643\u0644 \u0633\u062c\u0644 \u0648\u0635\u0641 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u064a\u0627\u0646 \u0648\u0642\u0637\u0627\u0639\u0647 \u0648\u0645\u0648\u0627\u0636\u064a\u0639\u0647 \u0648\u0631\u0648\u0627\u0628\u0637\u0647.", "theme": ["Organisation"], "theme_en": ["Organisation"], "theme_fr": ["Organisation"], "theme_es": ["Organizaci\u00f3n"], "theme_ar": ["\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u0638\u0645\u0629"], "keyword": ["UNESCO expertise", "UNESCO Chairs", "Category 2 centres", "Creative Cities", "Learning Cities", "World Book Capitals", "World Heritage", "Biosphere Reserves", "Global Geoparks"], "keyword_en": ["UNESCO expertise", "UNESCO Chairs", "Category 2 centres", "Creative Cities", "Learning Cities", "World Book Capitals", "World Heritage", "Biosphere Reserves", "Global Geoparks"], "keyword_fr": ["Expertise de l'UNESCO", "Chaires UNESCO", "Centres de cat\u00e9gorie 2", "Villes cr\u00e9atives", "Villes apprenantes", "Capitales mondiales du livre", "Patrimoine mondial", "R\u00e9serves de biosph\u00e8re", "G\u00e9oparcs mondiaux"], "keyword_es": ["Conocimientos especializados de la UNESCO", "C\u00e1tedras UNESCO", "Centros de categor\u00eda 2", "Ciudades Creativas", "Ciudades del Aprendizaje", "Capitales Mundiales del Libro", "Patrimonio Mundial", "Reservas de biosfera", "Geoparques mundiales"], "keyword_ar": ["\u062e\u0628\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u064a\u0648\u0646\u0633\u0643\u0648", "\u0643\u0631\u0627\u0633\u064a \u0627\u0644\u064a\u0648\u0646\u0633\u0643\u0648", "\u0645\u0631\u0627\u0643\u0632 \u0627\u0644\u0641\u0626\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062b\u0627\u0646\u064a\u0629", "\